    "description": "The Ten Item Personality Inventory (TIPI) is a 10-item self-report scale providing brief assessments of the Big Five personality dimensions: openness, conscientiousness, extraversion, agreeableness, and neuroticism. It is used when time or space constraints make a full personality battery impractical, particularly in large-scale surveys.",
